invariant: INV-46
file: src/mlkem_lanes.h
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh mlkem-vector
reason: the SSE2 noise widens the first eight coefficients with a logical
  shift, so -1 and -2 become 255 and 254 where mlk_sample_cbd writes -1
  and -2. Only an x86-64 compiler reads the line, so the script builds
  bin/mlkem_vector_equiv_test for x86-64 and runs it under qemu-x86_64.
  The lane skips without docker, and this then reports unguarded rather
  than caught.

--- old
    lanes_store(out, _mm_srai_epi16(_mm_unpacklo_epi8(first, first), 8));
--- new
    lanes_store(out, _mm_srli_epi16(_mm_unpacklo_epi8(first, first), 8));
